The Court will therefore examine the merits of the following grievances:

–  those of Mr Annenkov, Ms Suprunova, Ms Guseva, Ms Zakharova, Mr Khavantsev, Mr Khripunov and Mr Finskiy in relation to the events on 7 August 2009;

–  those of Mr Buzov in relation to the events on 10 August 2009.
